{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","灵魂反击"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","蓄力后挥出恐怖的一击，将期间受到的伤害加倍奉还。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","进入一段时间蓄力，蓄力结束后对范围内敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，并附加蓄力期间受到伤害的180%，且获得额外20%生命汲取效果。施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加蓄力期间受到伤害的200%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","若技能期间被打断，则托安的灵魂会替其完成挥砍。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加蓄力期间受到伤害的220%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","附加蓄力期间受到伤害的240%。"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","灵魂剥夺"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","吸取最高生命值敌人的一部分生命值并挪为己用。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择场上当前生命值最高且未被“灵魂剥夺”的敌人，吸收其18% + 1.5%当前生命值并增加等量自身生命上限，并使对方受到的伤害提升13%，直至战斗结束。本技能吸收的生命值至多不超过托安攻击力的600%。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","吸收生命值的数值提升至敌人20% + 1.5%当前生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","将会使对方受到的伤害提升16%，直至战斗结束。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","将会使对方受到的伤害提升17%，直至战斗结束。"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","黄泉归来"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","受到致命一击后可以复活一次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","托安受到最后一击后，会在短暂延时之后复活，并恢复40% + 4% HP的生命。每场战斗至多触发1次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":4,"end":8,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fatal"},{"start":24,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","恢复量提升至50% + 4% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","恢复量提升至60% + 4% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","触发该技能后还会获得500点能量。"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击或者技能导致的能量回复的数值，并且在未触发复活时有额外提升。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，攻击或技能使自身能量回复的回复量提升24%,当技能“黄泉归来”未被触发时，能量的回复量额外提升6%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，攻击或技能使自身能量回复的回复量提升32%,当技能“黄泉归来”未被触发时，能量的回复量额外提升8%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，攻击或技能使自身能量回复的回复量提升40%,当技能“黄泉归来”未被触发时，能量的回复量额外提升10%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","灵魂契约"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","替友军承担部分伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始前，托安会和位于身后一格的友军签订契约，在战斗中托安将替其承受50%伤害，直至战斗结束。托安受到最后一击后该友军会牺牲85%当前生命值使托安回复150%这部分生命值，随后托安便不再替友军承受伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backonehex"},{"start":52,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fatal"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","契约存在期间，该友军造成伤害的25%会治疗托安。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","友军造成伤害对托安的治疗量提升至30%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","友军造成伤害对托安的治疗量提升至35%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，会从敌人身上再次吸收生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，会从所有被“灵魂剥夺”影响的敌人身上再次吸收20%当前生命值并增加等量自身生命上限。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","憎恨之剑"]]}